Package: gb10-fan
Version: 0.2.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: gb10-fan maintainers <gb10-fan@localhost>
Depends: dkms, kmod, @SHLIBS@
Conflicts: nvfancontrol
Description: GB10 static fan floor and governor with passive DKMS module
 Userspace fan control with dynamically loaded NVML and the nvfancontrol
 kernel module. Provides a static RPM floor unit and a temperature-tracking
 governor unit, which are mutually exclusive. Installing this package does
 not load the module or enable or start either unit. Matching headers for
 every installed kernel are required at configuration and upgrade time.
